@startuml
actor User
participant Workspace
participant "Trusted API" as API
participant "AIProvider" as AI
participant "Registry + validators" as V
participant "Compute service" as Jobs
participant "Local provider / future governed adapter" as Provider
User -> Workspace : natural-language request
Workspace -> API : prompt + recipe + configuration
API -> API : size/rate limits, identity, dataset/project ACL
API -> AI : authorized catalog/AOI context
AI --> API : structured plan (untrusted)
API -> V : exact schema/tools/IDs/arguments
V --> API : validated plan or refusal
alt supported low-cost local analysis
 API -> Jobs : estimate, immutable owner/request snapshot
 Jobs -> Provider : bounded authorized operation
 Provider --> Jobs : actual result or failure
 Jobs --> API : validated result / usage
else approval required
 API --> Workspace : pending exact estimate/approval
 User -> API : explicit human approval
 API -> Jobs : reauthorize owner/hash/expiry/ceiling
 Jobs -> Provider : only when adapter available
else external adapter unavailable
 API --> Workspace : unavailable; no fabricated fallback
end
API --> Workspace : validated result + atomic recipe update
Workspace -> Workspace : stale-response guard, one Undo entry
@enduml
